  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Preparation and Support Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This component will develop a project preparation facility to build a pipeline of climate investments for Blended Finance Facility, with a special focus on climate adaptation of which there are limited projects in Pakistan. It will also provide pre- and post-investment advisory support to strengthen investees&#x2019; operational efficiency, enhance investees impact reach &#x2013; such as by strengthening inclusion practices and Environmental, Social and Governance (ESG) compliance.</narrative>
  </description>
